      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.03,
          "end": 5.34,
          "en": "So let's build this Icon button together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.34,
          "end": 8.04,
          "en": "For this in Components I'll add a new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.667,
          "end": 12.365,
          "en": "the Icon Button JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.365,
          "end": 16.64,
          "en": "and in there of course I define the Icon Button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.64,
          "end": 19.713,
          "en": "and as always, we then export it like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.65,
          "end": 22.54,
          "en": "And then in there, we in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.54,
          "end": 25.45,
          "en": "want to have a Pressable icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.45,
          "end": 29.2,
          "en": "So what we can do to achieve this is use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.2,
          "end": 32.09,
          "en": "the Pressable component from react-native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.09,
          "end": 36.81,
          "en": "and data from at the import, and use an icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.81,
          "end": 40.32,
          "en": "And for icons, we already learned that we can use icons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.32,
          "end": 43.5,
          "en": "from @expo vector icons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.714,
          "end": 47.453,
          "en": "and there I like the Ionicans",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.453,
          "end": 48.286,
          "en": "quite a bit, but it's up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.286,
          "end": 49.74,
          "en": "which icons you want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.74,
          "end": 54.017,
          "en": "Then you use the imported icons here as a component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.017,
          "end": 58.71,
          "en": "So in my case Ionicons and we now just have to set the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.71,
          "end": 61.07,
          "en": "which identifies the icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.07,
          "end": 64.57,
          "en": "And here I'll use a star for this demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.57,
          "end": 67.51,
          "en": "Give it a size maybe of 24.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.51,
          "end": 68.77,
          "en": "Let's see how that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.77,
          "end": 71.61,
          "en": "If that looks good and a color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.61,
          "end": 74.32300000000001,
          "en": "and here I'll hardcode this to white.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.73,
          "end": 78.44,
          "en": "Now we can add more styling in a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.44,
          "end": 80.503,
          "en": "For the moment that's my component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.07900000000001,
          "end": 83.982,
          "en": "And now in Meal Detail Screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.982,
          "end": 85.98,
          "en": "instead of using this standard button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.98,
          "end": 89.123,
          "en": "I will use my Icon Button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.123,
          "end": 92.12,
          "en": "Therefore we can get rid of the standard button import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.12,
          "end": 95.84,
          "en": "and make sure our icon button gets imported instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.84,
          "end": 97.53999999999999,
          "en": "Now we of course want to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.743,
          "end": 101.31,
          "en": "that when it's tapped, we still trigger this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.31,
          "end": 103.86,
          "en": "And therefore in the icon button, we should add the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.839,
          "end": 107.96000000000001,
          "en": "on Press prop on Pressable and expect some props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.96000000000001,
          "end": 111.75999999999999,
          "en": "on the Icon button as well, for example, on press",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.75999999999999,
          "end": 114.33,
          "en": "or on tapped or however you want to name it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.33,
          "end": 116.65299999999999,
          "en": "It's your prop so the name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.72200000000001,
          "end": 121.53,
          "en": "And then we forward that to the on press prop of Pressable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.53,
          "end": 123.16,
          "en": "So whichever function we receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.343,
          "end": 127.176,
          "en": "on this prop will be bound to pressable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.176,
          "end": 128.64,
          "en": "And therefore now in the Meal Detail screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.64,
          "end": 130.38,
          "en": "we can now add on press here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.38,
          "end": 133.903,
          "en": "and point at the header button, Press Handler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.87,
          "end": 138.63,
          "en": "With that, we got this Pressable star.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.63,
          "end": 140.92000000000002,
          "en": "We don't get any visual feedback right now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.941,
          "end": 145.393,
          "en": "but we can see a bunch of Press locks in the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.393,
          "end": 146.226,
          "en": "So this worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.527,
          "end": 149.99,
          "en": "Now of course, some visual feedback would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.99,
          "end": 152.95,
          "en": "and the icon also should be configurable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.95,
          "end": 156.29,
          "en": "Therefore I'll add a icon prop, which I use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.29,
          "end": 158.513,
          "en": "instead of the hardcoded Star here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.94299999999998,
          "end": 161.454,
          "en": "And we can also make the color configurable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.454,
          "end": 164.35,
          "en": "Instead of the hardcoded white so that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.35,
          "end": 166.32,
          "en": "we could use this icon somewhere else",
