        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 186.974,
          "end": 191.893,
          "en": "And then regarding the styling on Pressable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.287,
          "end": 195.09,
          "en": "In the end I want to make sure that when we press",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.09,
          "end": 198.46,
          "en": "this we have a little bit of an opacity effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.46,
          "end": 201.701,
          "en": "So I'll add my pressed styling object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.701,
          "end": 205.773,
          "en": "where I set the opacity to 0.5 or 0.7 maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.63,
          "end": 210.803,
          "en": "And then on Pressable, we add style except",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.803,
          "end": 213.01,
          "en": "dysfunction about which you learned earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.075,
          "end": 216.14,
          "en": "which gets an object which holds a pressed property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.14,
          "end": 218.763,
          "en": "which is a bullion which is true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.763,
          "end": 221.013,
          "en": "if the button is pressed and false otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.298,
          "end": 224.035,
          "en": "And then we check if press is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.035,
          "end": 226.93,
          "en": "and if that is the case, we add styles.pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.93,
          "end": 229.713,
          "en": "and otherwise no specific style is set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.649,
          "end": 233.04,
          "en": "And with that, it's gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 233.04,
          "end": 235.37,
          "en": "because we now have to set icon and color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.37,
          "end": 237.93,
          "en": "now that I added these new props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.93,
          "end": 240.02,
          "en": "So back in Meal Detail Screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.02,
