        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.64,
          "end": 249.74,
          "en": "and to color I'll still set this to white here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.74,
          "end": 252.74,
          "en": "So now with this, we added the icon button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.721,
